<h2>How we compare products</h2>
<p>We link official product documentation and store listings, disclose that we make Cortisol+, and distinguish documented features from hands-on testing. Scores from different apps are not interchangeable. Prices, trial eligibility and supported devices can change; verify the current offer before subscribing.</p>
<p>For another way to explore the tradeoffs, see our <a href="/resources/perplexity/#apple-watch-apps">shared Perplexity app-comparison conversations</a>. We requested these AI answers and show the prompts; they are not independent reviews.</p>
